  "description": "gRPC transport binding for Orleans.Lattice.Api.Auth. Exposes the membership and authorization-policy control facade (group, membership, and rule CRUD, plus Explain and EffectivePermissions) as unary gRPC RPCs over a code-first, Orleans-serialized contract, with a header-based identity bridge, a pluggable coarse meta-authorization seam, and a default-deny posture. Administering policy is the most sensitive surface in the cluster, so the binding fails closed: with no authorizer registered every admin call is rejected. Registered with AddLatticeAuthApiGrpc(...) and mapped with MapLatticeAuthApiGrpc().",
